{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063259/block/singleImage/3264452/df/01M74ZG78AYSBATFP3BBTPEVGN.jpg?updatedAt=1794389979\"/><figcaption>太古城園景兩房獲用家1018萬承接，17年升值近8成。</figcaption></figure><p>樓市目光聚焦一手新盤，二手市場暫受壓。中原地產太古城齊宮閣分行區域營業董事王秀芬表示，太古城本月至今暫錄 3 宗成交。其中分行新近促成恆天閣低層 G 室易手，單位實用面積 567 平方呎，屬兩房間隔，望內園景。最新獲用家以 1,018 萬元承接，折合實用呎價 19,048 元。 原業主獲利 450 萬元離場 據了解，原業主早於 2009 年 9 月以 568 萬元買入上述單位。持貨 17 年後是次沽出，賬面獲利 450 萬元，單位期內升值近 8 成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:56:46.245475+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":255,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:39:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T22:38:45.256045+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:50:07.962164+00:00","content_hash":"81a7e053a0e447317d9c8f01be5325a047121f066b2f88aeaeeaa04f3057e940","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:56:46.245475+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}